Suppose we want to add two numbers several times.
Without functions:
let result = 10 + 20;
console.log(result);
result = 30 + 40;
console.log(result);
result = 50 + 60;
console.log(result);
This approach leads to code duplication.
Using functions:
function add(i, j) {
